WEBVTT

00:04:59.546 --> 00:05:01.574
the artisanal fishermen on the Pacific --

00:05:01.598 --> 00:05:04.313
all historically forgotten

00:05:04.337 --> 00:05:05.892
or underappreciated.

00:05:06.666 --> 00:05:10.462
Thanks to this movement,
we began to envision

00:05:10.486 --> 00:05:15.078
an opportunity to build
a space of mutual trust,

00:05:15.102 --> 00:05:17.898
an environment of trust
that would allow us

00:05:17.922 --> 00:05:20.137
to work toward collective goals

00:05:20.811 --> 00:05:23.698
that were much more important
and transcendental.

00:05:23.722 --> 00:05:25.858
Thanks to this movement,

00:05:25.882 --> 00:05:29.116
we started to imagine a Peruvian cuisine

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:31.928
that would bring a new message